    {
      "id": "5b3e1a2c-0010-4d6e-9f70-8a1b2c3d4e5f",
      "name": "Read the transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1540,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The SRT transcript as cues: start and end in seconds, and the words.\nconst secs = (s) => { const [h, m, rest] = s.trim().replace(',', '.').split(':'); return Number(h) * 3600 + Number(m) * 60 + Number(rest); };\nconst cues = [];\nfor (const block of String($json.srt ?? '').replace(/\\r/g, '').split(/\\n\\s*\\n/)) {\n  const lines = block.trim().split('\\n');\n  const at = lines.findIndex((l) => l.includes('-->'));\n  if (at < 0) continue;\n  const [from, to] = lines[at].split('-->');\n  const text = lines.slice(at + 1).join(' ').trim();\n  if (text) cues.push({ start: secs(from), end: secs(to), text });\n}\nif (!cues.length) throw new Error('The transcript is empty. Does the video have speech in it?');\nconst source = $('Check the transcript').first().json.data.attributes;\nreturn [{ json: { cues, video: source.source, width: source.width, height: source.height, duration: source.duration } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3e1a2c-0011-4d6e-9f70-8a1b2c3d4e5f",
      "name": "Claude translates",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "maxTries": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Translate this video's speech for a dubbed version in each of these languages: {{ $('Your video').first().json.languages }}.\n\nThe speech, one numbered line per caption, with how long each one lasts:\n{{ $('Read the transcript').first().json.cues.map((c, i) => (i + 1) + '. (' + (c.end - c.start).toFixed(1) + ' s) ' + c.text).join('\\n') }}\n\nFor each language, translate every line, keeping the same number of lines in the same order. Each translation has to fit the time the original line takes, so shorten the wording rather than add to it. Keep names and brands as they are. Spell out numbers.\n\nReply with JSON only, no code fence. code is the language's two-letter ISO 639-1 code:\n{\"languages\": [{\"name\": \"Spanish\", \"code\": \"es\", \"lines\": [\"...\"]}]}",
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3e1a2c-0012-4d6e-9f70-8a1b2c3d4e5f",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "position": [
        1780,
        220
