    {
      "id": "5b3e1a2c-0018-4d6e-9f70-8a1b2c3d4e5f",
      "name": "Claude fixes the translation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "maxTries": 2,
      "position": [
        2980,
        660
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Your translation needs fixing.\n\nThe problem: {{ $json.problems }}\n\nYour reply:\n{{ $('Check the translation').first().json.text }}\n\nFix the problem and keep the rest. The brief:\n\nTranslate this video's speech for a dubbed version in each of these languages: {{ $('Your video').first().json.languages }}.\n\nThe speech, one numbered line per caption, with how long each one lasts:\n{{ $('Read the transcript').first().json.cues.map((c, i) => (i + 1) + '. (' + (c.end - c.start).toFixed(1) + ' s) ' + c.text).join('\\n') }}\n\nFor each language, translate every line, keeping the same number of lines in the same order. Each translation has to fit the time the original line takes, so shorten the wording rather than add to it. Keep names and brands as they are. Spell out numbers.\n\nReply with JSON only, no code fence. code is the language's two-letter ISO 639-1 code:\n{\"languages\": [{\"name\": \"Spanish\", \"code\": \"es\", \"lines\": [\"...\"]}]}",
        "promptType": "define"
